{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01UrEXxoFLRyLWzEUGonVdFf","type":"tool_result","content":"74\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-019: Scale RAG to 10M+ articles — horizontal shard fan-out (5M vectors/shard, scatter-gather merge), 3-layer caching (embedding→semantic→response, GPTCache), staged retrieval (ANN top-100→BM25 top-20→cross-encoder top-5), CDC-driven incremental ingestion, speculative shard timeout pattern, cost comparison Pinecone vs self-hosted Qdrant at scale\n75\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-020: RAG returns relevant docs but users can't find the answer — search engine vs answer engine; RAGAS context_recall vs answer_relevancy diagnostic split, context dumping / lost-in-middle / query reformulation gap failure modes, synthesis prompt fix + top-k reduction + graceful fallback pattern\n76\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-021: How evaluate a RAG pipeline? — two-layer eval (retrieval: Recall@5/MRR/NDCG/Precision@k on golden dataset; generation: RAGAS Faithfulness/Answer Relevancy/Context Precision/Context Recall), golden dataset regression gates, production signals (deflection rate, p95 latency, thumbs-down), BLEU/ROUGE pitfall, cost tradeoff gpt-4o vs gpt-4o-mini judge\n77\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-022: Citations and source attribution in RAG — metadata-at-ingestion pipeline, numbered source-block prompting, NLI entailment citation validation (DeBERTa, <0.75 threshold), structured JSON citation response for frontend rendering\n78\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-023: How does ANN search work? HNSW indexing? — layered skip-graph construction, O(log N) greedy descent, M/ef_construction/ef_search parameter guide, FAISS IVF+PQ vs HNSW tradeoff, filtered-search recall-collapse pitfall, Pinecone/Qdrant/FAISS tooling\n79\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-024: Where do embeddings fail? — negation (polarity ignored by contrastive training, cosine>0.85 between X and not-X), temporal/exact-match precision (BPE fragments rare strings, no time axis, metadata filter mitigation), conjunctive queries; mitigations: BM25 hybrid search + RRF, cross-encoder reranking, structured metadata filters\n80\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-025: Semantic caching — reduce cost and latency — three-layer caching stack (response/embedding/retrieval cache), GPTCache/FAISS/Redis mechanics, cosine similarity threshold tuning (0.92–0.97), TTL+invalidation strategy, cost math at 1M queries/day (30% hit rate = $3K/day saved)\n81\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-026: RAG with multi-turn conversation context — query reformulation (condense-to-standalone via GPT-4o-mini), Redis session state with TTL, ConversationSummaryBufferMemory rolling summary, cost breakdown at 1M sessions/day, 3-turn reformulation sweet spot, session scoping pitfall\n82\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-027: Key tradeoffs — latency vs accuracy, chunk size vs context, cost vs quality — tradeoff triangle framework, parent-child chunking, cross-encoder reranker ROI, semantic caching as latency offset, model tiering cost math at 1M queries/day, RAGAS production SLOs\n83\t2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-028: Optimize RAG latency in production? — 4-stage profiling framework (embed/retrieve/rerank/generate), model tiering GPT-4o-mini vs GPT-4o, streaming TTFT vs total latency, semantic caching (cosine>0.93, 30% hit rate), bi-encoder pre-filter for reranker (100→20 candidates), HNSW ef_search tuning, before/after latency table"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e34af413-c6bd-4f65-b191-686de090d275","uuid":"08b09135-4100-42f5-8c6a-1f881adf7f87","timestamp":"2026-06-16T16:07:13.450Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sarthakagarwal/Desktop/projects/prep/ai-engineering/progress.txt","content":"2026-06-16 | 02-rag-systems | wrote answer 02-019: Scale RAG to 10M+ articles — h